Frigid River
The river descends here into a valley. There is a narrow beach on the east below the cliffs, and there is some shore on the west which may be suitable. In the distance a faint rumbling can be heard.

You can see a magic boat here.

In the magic boat you see a tan label, a sharp stick, yourself, and a red buoy.

